{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1635724800, "end_date": 1636329599, "month_true_total": 214, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:54 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "102411153", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023759656", "personaname": "kergonan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023759656/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 5067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5067, "last_played": 1636326619, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fine game in its own right, but the endgame is a bit lackluster. I still prefer the original trilogy.", "timestamp_created": 1636326714, "timestamp_updated": 1636326714, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497978776693344116", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102408796", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027028058", "personaname": "major_smoke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027028058/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 4112, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4112, "last_played": 1626543936, "avatar": "024a0339e8741e1c0dbcb4f9dee439d94d7c6580"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not as good as Mass Effect 2 or Mass Effect 3, but still a good game to play. The way the story ended, I will look forward to whatever game comes after this one.", "timestamp_created": 1636322824, "timestamp_updated": 1636322824, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497978776693344116", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102407319", "author": {"steamid": "76561198427254950", "personaname": "Angelicus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198427254950/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2251, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 803, "last_played": 1637004236, "avatar": "0c7eff4e27c2d0ee6e9d01aee0852daa8ee2e1ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Being a huge fan of the original Mass Effect trilogy (despite the controversial ending/s) I was dubious about whether to purchase Andromeda upon release; and after all the negative reviews and lots of bugs reported, etc, I felt as though I had dodged one big, fat, animated bullet. But recently I thought 'What the hell.' Trudging through the opening hours I was still unsure I had made a wise decision, but I soon realised that I wanted to know more of the story, I wanted to upgrade my armour and weapons, and I wanted to explore more planets for this and that. Now, i'm not saying it's as good as the originals, far from it; but in my opinion perhaps it didn't get a fair trial at the beginning of it's life. Maybe it was over hyped before release, maybe i'm just one in a minority, but i'm actually enjoying playing it, and maybe you will too..?", "timestamp_created": 1636320533, "timestamp_updated": 1636320533, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102405754", "author": {"steamid": "76561198026589610", "personaname": "GAZ", "persona_status":